{
	"_note": "Every control, by what you are doing. Each action row is an InputMap action built at startup (view/bindings.gd): \"key\" and \"pad\" list its default bindings, and the player's changes are saved in user://settings.cfg. Specs: keys by name (W, Shift, BracketLeft, KP Enter); pad buttons a b x y lb rb back start lstick rstick dpad_up dpad_down dpad_left dpad_right; pad axes lx ly rx ry lt rt with a sign (lx- is the stick pushed left). Rows with \"text\" are just notes. Two actions in the same scope (or a global one) cannot share a binding.",
	"gamepad": {"deadzone": 0.25, "trigger_deadzone": 0.1, "capture_threshold": 0.6},
	"reserved": {"key": ["Escape"], "pad": ["back"]},
